WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.829
A mistake? "Match" → "Corrections".

2
00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:09.032
The "Correction board" draws the match like the scoreboard. Nothing is saved until "Save".

3
00:00:09.082 --> 00:00:12.603
"Last point went to the wrong team": the point moves to the other team.

4
00:00:12.653 --> 00:00:16.371
A rally was not entered: "+" beside the team's score ("−" takes one away).

5
00:00:16.421 --> 00:00:22.408
Line-up, time-outs and substitutions: tap them on the board. Sanctions, libero, remarks, coin toss and numbers: the buttons below.

6
00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:25.823
The changes are listed at the bottom. "Undo" takes back the last one.

7
00:00:25.873 --> 00:00:32.761
"Save": check the changes, then save them. The referee sees them in the correction log.

8
00:00:32.811 --> 00:00:39.811
A set closed too early? On the board, choose the set, then "Reopen set". The sets after it are deleted.

9
00:00:44.122 --> 00:00:46.688
Set 1 is open again at 25:20: "Decision change" fixes its last point.

10
00:00:46.738 --> 00:00:49.105
Or "Confirm" ends it again.
